        babyTiredness: -1
        parentEnergy: -1
        parentHunger: -1
        parentStress: -1
        parentJoy: -1
        babyAsleep: 0
      signatureMoment: The baby grips your finger.
    - number: 2
      title: Night Shift
      month: 1
      objective: Night feeds every 2-3 hours. Sleep whenever the baby sleeps, and
        reach 07:00 with Energy above 20.
      briefing: 'It''s 21:00 and the baby is tired after a long day. Settle them
        in the crib, then get some sleep yourself: time runs four times faster while
        you sleep. The baby will wake you for feeds through the night.'
      failHint: Go to bed as soon as the baby is asleep - every hour of sleep restores
        Energy.
      tutorial: 0
      startHour: 21
      lengthMinutes: 600
      cryingBudgetMinutes: 60
      maxContinuousCryMinutes: 30
      allowance: 40
      helpCalls: 1
